{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google正在採取更多措施，讓人工智能搜索體驗繼續面向免費用户開放。隨着AI Mode逐步成為Google Search的重要組成部分，Google不僅擴大了相關功能的覆蓋範圍，還允許用户將Gmail和Google Photos等個人服務連接到搜索系統，使人工智能能夠結合用户自己的信息提供個性化回答，而不必強制用户訂閲付費套餐。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584272.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:32:48.967520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:20:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.823005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.823005+00:00","content_hash":"836eff98231fc6d6ef4ca8b1d6773742453f6ddc323b5042476d6d66550327ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}